{"synopsis":"Setelah 6 tahun bermain tanpa henti, Lee Jin-ho akhirnya menyelesaikan game Reset Life yang terkenal kejam, sebuah simulator neraka yang mengharuskan Anda menyelesaikan 99 akhir cerita yang berbeda untuk menang.\n\nDan sekarang? “… Apa yang harus saya lakukan dengan hidup saya?”\n\nDihancurkan oleh kekosongan dan depresi pasca-game, dia dihantam dengan kenyataan baru – kehidupan nyatanya telah diatur ulang.\nTapi kali ini, ini bukan permainan.\nTiba-tiba, dia bukan lagi seorang gamer yang tertutup. Dia adalah seorang siswa berprestasi nasional, model peragawati, koki, dan bahkan bintang hiburan.\nDalam kehidupan baru ini… setiap jalan terbuka, dan setiap akhir cerita adalah miliknya untuk dibentuk.","alternative_title":"게임 폐인의 리셋 라이프","author":"FineMan, LuckyKi","artist":"FineMan, LuckyKi","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c0a7979d-5750-45ab-a816-9a7887c1e069","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2025-12-16","released":"2025-12-16"},{"chapter_id":"0f3a1948-d441-4aef-8bc1-218c9d42d00a","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2025-12-10","released":"2025-12-10"},{"chapter_id":"d6534efb-bcf7-48e4-b26f-10f7f2e0a290","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2025-12-03","released":"2025-12-03"},{"chapter_id":"00edf271-0b5b-4e79-bd8a-baa6f3f47a15","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2025-11-26","released":"2025-11-26"},{"chapter_id":"0b9f3431-c924-4d4c-a372-6dc073488c45","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2025-11-20","released":"2025-11-20"},{"chapter_id":"dc2d513b-3902-4069-bf0a-f0e1c459aaf1","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2025-11-12","released":"2025-11-12"},{"chapter_id":"56a7cc15-fbde-4caa-b36d-8c06c21a8572","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2025-11-05","released":"2025-11-05"},{"chapter_id":"578d2b25-6dc4-4511-8a47-a6296e20f758","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2025-10-28","released":"2025-10-28"},{"chapter_id":"18d7d979-1f23-482e-9975-32db65d1d499","number":"45","ch